OL,3,GNEWSACare home resident, 98, died of
OL,4,A'traumatic injuries'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 98-year-old woman died from
OL,7,F"traumatic brain and chest injuries"
OL,8,Fafter she was allegedly assaulted by
OL,9,Fanother resident at a care home, a
OL,10,Fcoroner has heard.
OL,12,FAn inquest has opened at Norfolk's
OL,13,FCoroner's Court into the death of Emma
OL,14,FMaud Sharpe, a retired cafe owner from
OL,15,FGrantham, who died at the James Paget
OL,16,FHospital in Gorleston on 19 April.
OL,18,FShe had been a resident at the Windmill
OL,19,FCare Home in Rollesby when she was
OL,20,Fattacked - and died six days later from
OL,21,Fher injuries.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
