OL,3,GNEWSACare home resident, 98, died of
OL,4,A'traumatic injuries'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 60s was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder but has
OL,8,Fsince been sectioned under the Mental
OL,9,FHealth Act. The care home has been
OL,10,Fplaced in special measures.
